<section class="section">

<h2>
Founder Vision
</h2>

<p>
We believe modern visual storytelling has become overly loud, fast, and forgettable. Montage Studios was created to pursue a more cinematic and emotionally resonant approach to perception.
</p>

</section>

<section class="section">

<h2>
Creative Principles
</h2>

<p>
